devsig chipid    0x20           0x20           ok   DEVICE-SIGNATURE: CHIPID reads PCC2_ID through a guest ld.bu (RAM would read 0)
named wr         survived       survived       ok   guest st.b at all 18 named unimplemented registers in ONE session: (b) reinstated exit(1) kills on the first
named wr msg     1              18             FAIL one announce PER OFFSET: a whole-arm latch prints 1, an unlatched arm prints 18 too -- see `latch sameoff'
