named rd msg     1              18             FAIL the read announce fires once per offset too
named rd srvd    1              18             FAIL the read announce says what happened -- SERVED (the array's byte), never 'ignored'
inword wr        survived       survived       ok   a byte inside each 32-bit counter/compare word (0x05, 0x09, 0x0d, 0x11): no case -> default:
