alias msg        1              1              ok   ...and the announce names the FOLDED offset 0x2a: a changed fold names another
dir wr text      1              1              ok   the announce says WRITE for a store (an inverted writeflag test in the text says read)
dir rd text      1              1              ok   ...and READ for a load
genctl rt        0x82           0x82           ok   an IMPLEMENTED byte register still round-trips (no C040 bit in 0x82)
t1cmp word rt    0x12345678     0x12345678     ok   the cased 32-bit counter arm still round-trips a word: the fix swallowed no cased arm
